        "collapsed": false,
        "content": "Booking intervals are half-open [start,end). merge returns sorted tuples and does not mutate inputs.\n\nRuntime: Python 3.10+ standard library; no installation or network needed.\nExisting smoke checks: python3 -B -m unittest discover -s tests -v",
        "id": "1b3f4833-d9dd-41c2-9894-92d87c3be75d",
        "isError": false,
        "ordinal": 61,
